# Applies to `moon publish` / `moon package` only -- the build is unaffected,
# so CI still compiles the test harnesses below from the repo.
#
# Patterns resolve against the WORKSPACE root, not this module. A directory
# pattern naming a sibling (e.g. "modules/") therefore empties that module's
# archive, silently. Keep this file to test code only.

# blackbox and whitebox tests
*_test.mbt
*_wbtest.mbt

# test-harness packages (consumers never build these)
_tests/
bun_test/
_interop_test/
